{"speciesId":275,"names":{"fr":"Tengalice","es":"Shiftry","en":"Shiftry","ja":"ダーテング"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"SHIFTRY is a mysterious POKéMON that is said to live atop towering trees dating back over a thousand years. It creates terrific windstorms with the fans it holds."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"SHIFTRY’s large fans generate awesome gusts of wind at a speed close to 100 feet per second. The whipped-up wind blows anything away. This POKéMON chooses to live quietly deep in forests."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It is said to arrive on chilly, wintry winds. Feared from long ago as the guardian of forests, this POKéMON lives in a deep forest where people do not venture."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"A POKéMON that was feared as a forest guardian. It can read the foe’s mind and take preemptive action."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"A POKéMON that was feared as a forest guardian. It can read the foe’s mind and take preemptive action."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"By flapping its leafy fan, it can whip up gusts of 100 ft/second that can level houses."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"By flapping its leafy fan, it can whip up gusts of 100 ft/second that can level houses."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"By flapping its leafy fan, it can whip up gusts of 100 ft/second that can level houses."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It lives quietly in the deep forest. It is said to create chilly winter winds with the fans it holds."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It lives quietly in the deep forest. It is said to create chilly winter winds with the fans it holds."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"D’un coup de sa feuille éventail, il génère des bourrasques de 30 m/s capables de souffler une maison."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"By flapping its leafy fan, it can whip up gusts of 100 ft/second that can level houses."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"D’un coup de sa feuille éventail, il génère des bourrasques de 30 m/s capables de souffler une maison."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"By flapping its leafy fan, it can whip up gusts of 100 ft/second that can level houses."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"By flapping its leafy fan, it can whip up gusts of 100 ft/second that can level houses."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"By flapping its leafy fan, it can whip up gusts of 100 ft/second that can level houses."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ce Pokémon est le gardien des forêts. Il peut lire les pensées de ses ennemis et agir en conséquence."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Habita los bosques y se le tiene miedo. Es capaz de leer los pensamientos del rival y actuar en consecuencia."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"A Pokémon that was feared as a forest guardian. It can read the foe’s mind and take preemptive action."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"森の 神様と 恐れられていた ポケモン。相手の 考えを 読み 先回りする 能力を 持つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"D’un coup de sa feuille éventail, il génère des bourrasques de 30 m/s capables de souffler une maison."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Con sus abanicos puede provocar vientos de 30 m/s capaces de levantar casas."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"By flapping its leafy fan, it can whip up gusts of 100 feet per second that can level houses."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"葉っぱの ウチワを あおぐと 風速３０メートルの 突風が 巻き起こり 民家を 吹き飛ばす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Tengalice est un mystérieux Pokémon vivant dans les cimes d’immenses arbres, vieux de plus de mille ans. Il peut créer de formidables tempêtes grâce à ses éventails."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Shiftry es un enigmático Pokémon que vive, dicen, en las copas de los árboles milenarios. Este Pokémon genera fuertes corrientes de aire con los abanicos que lleva en las manos."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Shiftry is a mysterious Pokémon that is said to live atop towering trees dating back over a thousand years. It creates terrific windstorms with the fans it holds."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"樹齢 １０００年を 超えた 大木の てっぺんに すむと いわれる 謎の ポケモン。 葉っぱの 団扇で 強風を 巻き起こす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Les grands éventails de Tengalice peuvent déclencher des bourrasques de vent allant jusqu’à 30 m/s. Le vent déchaîné peut tout envoyer balader. Ce Pokémon a choisi de vivre tranquillement dans la forêt."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Las grandes manos con forma de hoja que tiene Shiftry generan grandes corrientes de aire que pueden alcanzar 30 m/s y barrer lo que sea. Este Pokémon opta por vivir tranquilo en medio del bosque."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Shiftry’s large fans generate awesome gusts of wind at a speed close to 100 feet per second. The whipped-up wind blows anything away. This Pokémon chooses to live quietly deep in forests."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"大きな 団扇は 風速 ３０メートルの 強風を 起こし なんでも 吹き飛ばす。 森の 奥で ひっそり 暮らす ポケモンだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ce gardien des forêts inspirait la crainte. Il peut lire les pensées de ses ennemis et agir en conséquence."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Infundía temor por su condición de guardián de los bosques. Es capaz de leer los pensamientos del rival y actuar en consecuencia."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"A Pokémon that was feared as a forest guardian. It can read the foe’s mind and take preemptive action."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"森の 神様と 恐れられていた ポケモン。 相手の 考えを 読み 先回りする 能力を もつ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il vit caché au fond des forêts. On raconte qu’il fait souffler la bise lorsqu’il agite ses grands éventails."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text"